1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:07,233
Night nine. It gets cold. Really cold.
You light the little camp stove on the
kitchen floor. Just to heat some soup.

2
00:00:07,933 --> 00:00:10,200
This is fine. Everything is fine.

3
00:00:10,867 --> 00:00:16,800
Ninety seconds. That's how fast smoke
fills a small room. The smoke detector
stays silent. No power.

4
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:24,133
I got to the window on my hands and
knees. Two puffs. Then I lay on the
cold floor and stared at the ceiling.

5
00:00:24,833 --> 00:00:29,167
Rule six. Never burn anything indoors.
Not once. Not even for soup.
